  "description": "The Sommet Carbon is a confidence inspiring 160mm enduro bike.\n\nThe Sommet handles technical downhills with ease, thanks to the modern aggressive geometry. Take your riding to the limits on your favourite trail or reach for the podium at your local enduro, the Sommet is with you all the way.\n\nThe Sommet CRX geometry is backed up by a slick performing components package. Including 170mm Fox Float 36 Factory FIT GRIP 2 forks, 160mm Fox Float DPX2 Factory shock that pivots on a sealed upper bearing, Shimano XTR/XT 1×12 gearing and XT8120 4 piston hydraulic disc brakes. Finished off with the high performance Maxxis 3C Tubeless ready tyres mounted on DT Swiss EX1501 30 wheels. No matter where you ride, the Sommet CRX will never be out of its depth.\n\nModern carbon frame with boost spacing and aggressive geometry\n\nShimano XT M28120 4 piston brakes with 203mm rotors\n\nShimano XTR/XT 1x12 speed groupset\n\nBrand-X Ascend Internal dropper post\n\nMRP ISCG Chain Guide\n\nMaxxis 3c Tubeless ready tyres with tubeless rim tape fitted and valves included",
